    "Calendrop needs to see your calendars and their events. Sign in again and leave both permissions ticked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calendrop はカレンダーとその予定を見る必要があります。もう一度サインインし、両方の権限にチェックを入れたままにしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Calendrop reads the calendars you choose for each account. Sign-in happens in your browser." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
